        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 9270-CNT, Touchpad Electronic Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe electronic touchpad allows you to lock and unlock the door without the use of a key. It has the versatility of keyless operation while still retaining the functionality of keyed entry, having both a keypad and lock cylinder on the outside and a thumb turn on the interior. It's perfect for front doors, side or back doors, and garage entry doors.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> Kwikset 9270-CNT Touch Pad Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMI Grade 2</li>\r\n<li>20 minute UL fire rating.</li>\r\n<li>SmartKey lock cylinder - allows you to re-key the lock in 3 easy steps.</li>\r\n<li>Backlit exterior keypad for increased visibility at night.</li>\r\n<li>Auto-locking after 30 seconds or select custom auto-lock time delay.</li>\r\n<li>Up to 50 user codes and 10 one-time user codes.</li>\r\n<li>1 inch deadbolt throw.</li>\r\n<li>Keypad stays lit for 10 seconds after inactivity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Key Code Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Length: 5-3/16</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Width: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable 1-3/8\" to1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for both 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" Crossbore Hole (Standard Pre-Drilled Door)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
